{"kp_id": "zj-048.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-048", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "肩痛须按经络辨大肠、三焦、小肠，勿凡肩痛皆取曲池。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li11", "meridian.te", "meridian.li", "meridian.si"], "chapter_id": "zj-048.c01", "evidence_quote": "不要说啊那个书上说曲直至肩膀痛", "seg_from": 3, "seg_to": 5, "start_s": 20.35, "end_s": 40.33, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z4eRK18Svho", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z4eRK18Svho&t=20s", "series": "zj", "episode": 48, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Humanity Series\" - \"Acupuncture\" (90 Episodes Total): Episode 48", "start_s": 20.35, "end_s": 40.33}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "曲直=曲池", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-048.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-048", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "天井为三焦合穴属土、子穴；屈肘两筋间凹陷直刺。可对侧取治膝痛。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.te10", "meridian.te"], "chapter_id": "zj-048.c01", "evidence_quote": "天井穴天女穴是三六经的合穴", "seg_from": 14, "seg_to": 27, "start_s": 74.41, "end_s": 153.71, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z4eRK18Svho", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z4eRK18Svho&t=74s", "series": "zj", "episode": 48, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Humanity Series\" - \"Acupuncture\" (90 Episodes Total): Episode 48", "start_s": 74.41, "end_s": 153.71}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "天女=天井；三六=三焦；殊途=属土", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-048.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-048", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "清冷渊在天井直上一寸；可治发热及三焦经臂痛、不能梳头等。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.te11", "acupoint.te10"], "chapter_id": "zj-048.c02", "evidence_quote": "从天井直上一寸，就是清冷约", "seg_from": 32, "seg_to": 59, "start_s": 170.5, "end_s": 288.645, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z4eRK18Svho", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z4eRK18Svho&t=170s", "series": "zj", "episode": 48, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Humanity Series\" - \"Acupuncture\" (90 Episodes Total): Episode 48", "start_s": 170.5, "end_s": 288.64}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "清冷约/青岭渊=清冷渊", "source": "llm_read"}
